OL,4,BVerstappen 'trusts' F1 over Middle     
OL,5,BEast decision                          
OL,6,GMax Verstappen says he "trusts"        
OL,7,GFormula 1 has made the right decision  
OL,8,Gin pressing ahead with the final two   
OL,9,Graces of the season in the Middle East.
OL,11,FLast week, F1 stood down preparations  
OL,12,Ffor a substitute race at Imola in      
OL,13,FItaly if the events in Qatar and Abu   
OL,14,FDhabi could not be held because of     
OL,15,Fongoing conflicts in the area.         
OL,17,FThe sport will now conclude the season 
OL,18,Fin the Middle East, unless the         
OL,19,Fsituation deteriorates before the      
OL,20,FQatar event on 27-29 November and Abu  
OL,21,FDhabi on 4-6 December.                 
